### Create listing
POST http://localhost:4000/api/listings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "title": "Test apartment for rent in Kabul",
  "description": "Nice two-bedroom apartment near city center",
  "price": 1200,
  "currency": "AFN",
  "listingType": "RENT",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "location": "Kabul",
  "address": "Street 10, Kabul",
  "contactVisibility": "HIDE_SELLER",
  "images": ["https://example.com/img1.jpg"]
}

### Get listing
GET http://localhost:4000/api/listings/{{listingId}}

### Approve listing (admin)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/listings/{{listingId}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_TOKEN>

{
  "contactVisibility": "SHOW_SELLER",
  "hideSellerContact": false,
  "notifyUser": true
}
